      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is really important, but knowing the current stance of the developers and how they think they know best (sometimes), I don't think I'll see this implemented any time soon. I've been told a number of times and experienced the lack of community cohesion, and there has been lots of trolls crashing worlds. That's the whole reason I essentially quit playing until a big change for the better happens in favor of what the PLAYERS want.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d07d31f766d6a0723f11d97",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5ad28c0c839dc146dd2b6d56",
        "alias": "Lava Lark",
        "aliasID": "65c45399ed6eefce4cc97f84",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/5de30d2a68146c138e5dcf99ea2e3ca6.png",
        "created": "2018-04-14T23:17:32.251Z",
        "name": "Fez",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2019-06-17T17:51:27.320Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 3,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5d0516fa974f400f354eb85f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 12
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Meanwhile public players are left out of the picture. We're stuck dealing with the RNG of finding other individuals who can hold a normal conversation. While also dealing with the Trust and Rank System that in some cases makes it impossible for mutes to communicate anymore and makes it almost impossible for new users to meet people. It's no wonder that the numbers are going down as the community is pushing everyone into the bubbles of influencer communities which are highly toxic and filled with people that despise outsiders. Hell, there's no longer events going on either.\n\nPublic players have the right to find a way to have discussions and talking to other individuals without issues. We demand a group finder system where we can create our own groups with names (Topics) and descriptions and a browser for said groups so we can find people to talk to. We want to escape the current status quo of being stuck in public without any chance of escape without spending money on influencers.\n\nSome of us want to take the first step, the invite and request system isn't part of that first step and currently for public players we are being mistreated with a horrible Trust and Rank System (REMOVE NAMEPLATE COLORS AND REDUCE IT TO A TRUST SYSTEM WITH SLIDERS FOR NO RANKS), influencers calling all of us trash and vermin + worse, completely unmoderated environment where we players need to do the moderation action instead of a voluntary moderation corps, complete RNG at finding decent individiuals you can conversate with meaning you can spend hours upon hours trying to find individuals just to talk about ONE specific thing, staff has directed all events to be community driven and therefore events are no longer being hosted for public users and everything event wise is influencer community driven meaning exclusivity is a common practice.\n\nIf they don't want to clean up Public, give us a group finder. We don't want to be cogs in the machines of the influencers who requires money from lonely and psychologically vulnerable individuals to continue making their VRChat content and to foster their communities. \n\nPlease don't neglect us anymore.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
